CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,FA court in the US has ordered
OL,7,FInstagram and Facebook parent company
OL,8,FMeta to pay $567 (#421.5 million) to
OL,9,Faddress harms to young people from its
OL,10,Fplatforms in the second phase of a
OL,11,Flandmark trial.
OL,13,FJudge Bryan Biedscheid said at a
OL,14,Fruling in New Mexico late on Thursday
OL,15,Fthat the bulk of the money ` $420
OL,16,Fmillion (#312.23 million) ` will be
OL,17,Fused for treatment services for young
OL,18,Fpeople.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,FThe rest will go toward awareness and
OL,7,Fprevention, screening services and
OL,8,Fother costs over the next five years.
OL,10,FThe new penalty is in addition to the
OL,11,F$375 million (#278.9 million) in civil
OL,12,Fpenalties that jurors ordered against
OL,13,FMeta in March, after determining the
OL,14,Fcompany knowingly harmed children's
OL,15,Fmental health and concealed what it
OL,16,Fknew about child sexual exploitation
OL,17,Fon its platforms.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,FIn the second phase, prosecutors asked
OL,7,Fthe judge to impose fundamental
OL,8,Fchanges at Meta aimed at reining in
OL,9,Faddictive features, improving age
OL,10,Fverification and preventing child
OL,11,Fsexual exploitation through default
OL,12,Fprivacy settings and closer oversight.
OL,14,FThe total amount Meta is responsible
OL,15,Ffor ` $942 million (#700.2 million) `
OL,16,Fis a small fraction of its annual
OL,17,Fprofit, which was about $60 billion
OL,18,F(#44.6 billion) in 2025.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,FInvestors seemed to shrug off the New
OL,7,FMexico ruling in after-hours trading
OL,8,FThursday, sending Meta's stock down
OL,9,Fless than half a percent to $589.44
OL,10,F(#438.130.
OL,12,FStill, the ruling is another setback
OL,13,Ffor Meta, which faces an avalanche of
OL,14,Flawsuits from thousands of families of
OL,15,Fchildren harmed by social media.
OL,17,FNew Mexico Attorney General Raul
OL,18,FTorrez said it sends an unmistakable
OL,19,Fmessage that companies will be held
OL,20,Faccountable when their product designs
OL,21,Fknowingly put children at risk.
OL,26,@yD@_rz
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,F"Today's decision is a victory for
OL,7,Fevery parent who has worried about
OL,8,Fwhat social media is doing to their
OL,9,Fchild and every child who deserves to
OL,10,Fgrow up safer online," he said in a
OL,11,Fstatement.
OL,13,FVowing to launch an appeal, the
OL,14,Fcompany said in a statement: "We work
OL,15,Fhard to keep people safe on our
OL,16,Fplatforms and have been transparent
OL,17,Fabout the challenges of identifying
OL,18,Fand removing bad actors and harmful
OL,19,Fcontent.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,F"We remain confident in our record of
OL,7,Fprotecting teens online and will
OL,8,Fcontinue to defend ourselves against
OL,9,Fclaims that misrepresent the facts."
OL,11,FThe judge ordered Facebook and
OL,12,FInstagram to build banner and
OL,13,Finformational screens to clearly
OL,14,Fexplain its protection features, best
OL,15,Fpractices and tools to address
OL,16,Finappropriate comment, for example,
OL,17,Fand display them regularly.
OL,19,FThose changes and an educational
OL,20,Fcampaign in New Mexico would be
OL,21,Fsubject to review by the state.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,FThe court said federal children's
OL,7,Fprivacy laws prevent Meta from
OL,8,Fapplying age-verification tools to
OL,9,Fchildren under 13, as the Children's
OL,10,FOnline Privacy Protection Act prevents
OL,11,Frequesting children to submit personal
OL,12,Fdata or tracking them online.
OL,14,FThe court also noted that ordering
OL,15,Fverification of children's ages only
OL,16,Ffor Meta and not other social media
OL,17,Fcompanies would be "inequitable and
OL,18,Funduly injurious" to the company.
OL,26,@yD@TOUzD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,FInstead, the court ordered Meta to
OL,7,Fcontinue to improve its age assurance
OL,8,Ftools in New Mexico, which include
OL,9,Fusing artificial intelligence to
OL,10,Fdetermine people's age based on
OL,11,Fsignals such as who their friends are
OL,12,Fand what types of content they post
OL,13,Fand consume.
OL,15,FMeta must also attempt to develop a
OL,16,Fdedicated "under-13-years-of-age
OL,17,Fprediction model" in the next two
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,FAdditionally, Meta should also request
OL,7,Fproof of age for Instagram and
OL,8,FFacebook users in New Mexico it
OL,9,Festimates to be under 13.
OL,11,FIf it determines a user to be under
OL,12,F13, or under 18 but without being able
OL,13,Fto estimate a specific age, Meta must
OL,14,Ftreat the user as under 13 or under 18
OL,15,Funtil the user verifies their age.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
