OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,FThe company must also partner with
OL,7,Fschools or a child safety organisation
OL,8,Fto create a reporting portal where
OL,9,Fschool staff can flag users who may be
OL,10,Funder 13. And it must delete personal
OL,11,Finformation it has collected on users
OL,12,Funder 13.
OL,14,FThe court also ordered Meta to report
OL,15,Fon its progress twice a year on how
OL,16,Fit's complying with the abatement
OL,17,Fmeasures.
OL,19,FMeta is also gearing up for a trial
OL,20,Flater this month in federal court in
OL,21,FOakland, California.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,FThere, Meta will face the first four
OL,7,Fof 29 states that sued it in a federal
OL,8,Fmulti-district lawsuit filed in 2023
OL,9,Ffor contributing to a youth mental
OL,10,Fhealth crisis by knowingly designing
OL,11,Faddictive features on Instagram and
OL,12,FFacebook.
OL,14,FEight US states, including Tennessee,
OL,15,Fwhere a trial is currently ongoing,
OL,16,Ffiled lawsuits in their own state
OL,17,Fcourts.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786128505
OL,3,CMeta fined $567 million over harms to
OL,4,Cchildren's mental health
OL,6,FAnd late last month, Meta, along with
OL,7,FTikTok, Snap and Google's YouTube,
OL,8,Fwere sued by the families of four
OL,9,Fteenagers who died by suicide over
OL,10,Fwhat they describe as "years of
OL,11,Fescalating harms" from using their
OL,12,Fplatforms.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
